ommission \r\n\t\t\t\t I&I Surcharge Waiver Request \r\n\t\t\t\t Sewer Ordinance \r\n\t\t\t Welfare Department \r\n\t\t\t\t Food Pantries \r\n\t\t\t\t Fuel Assistance \r\n\t\t\t\t Homeless & Transitional Shelters & Services \r\n\t\t\t\t Homeless Emergency Services \r\n\t\t\t\t Homeless Shelters \r\n\t\t\t\t How to Apply \r\n\t\t\t\t Senior Services \r\n\t\t\t\t Social Service Agencies \r\n\t\t\t\t Transitional Shelters \r\n\t\t\t\t Welfare Application (PDF) \r\nHome \nDepartments \r\nDepartments\t\t \r\n9 \n1 \n1 \n1 \t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tAssessing\r\nOffers property assessment information and GIS mapping resources for Epping residents and property owners.\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tBuilding Department\r\nThis page has information on the Building Department, including staff contacts and phone details. \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tETV\r\nVisit the ETV on this page. \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tFinance Department\r\nThis page has information on the Finance Department, including staff contacts and phone details. \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tFire Department\r\nThis page has information on the Fire Department, including its mission, leadership, and social media presence. \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tPolice Department\r\nThis page has information on the Epping Police Department, including the chief’s message, contact details, and staff directory. \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tPublic Works\r\nManages Epping’s transfer station, highways, and water/sewer services while providing support for resident inquiries.\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tRecreation Department\r\nOffers programs and activities that promote health, skills, and community connections for Epping residents of all ages.\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tTax Collector\r\nHandles Epping’s tax collection and clerk services, including payments, records, and official town documents.\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tTown Administrator\r\nOversees Epping’s daily town operations, budgets, and staff while advising the Select Board on policy and administration.\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tTown Clerk\r\nManages Epping’s official records, licensing, and vital documents while also serving as Tax Collector.\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tTransfer Station\r\nShares operating hours, permit details, and guidelines for disposing of household waste and recyclables. \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tWater & Sewer at W/S Plant\r\nOversees Epping’s water and wastewater treatment services to ensure safe, reliable utility operations for the community.\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t\t\tWelfare Department\r\nOffers assistance resources, application details, and guidelines for residents seeking local welfare and support services. \r\n\t\t\t\t Link to page \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \n\t\t\t Town Updates \r\n\t\t\t Boards & Commissions \n\t\t\t Departments \n\t\t\t Online Services \n\t\t\t Forms & Documents \nContact Us \r\nTown of Epping \r\n157 Main Street \r\nEpping, NH 03042 \r\nPhone:  603-679-5441 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Epping Community Theater \n         Conservation Commission \n         Epping Library \n         Parks and Rec \n         Epping Schools \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Contact Us \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
